Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.20,0:00:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Independent Prefectural Committee"\N"Regarding female student's suicide, bul--\Ndetermined to not have been a factor"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.50,0:00:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Aiko?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.29,0:00:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey... Who am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.70,0:00:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Honoka.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.58,0:00:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.58,0:00:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The name of the person\Nwho that thing is based on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.41,0:00:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Aiko died and her bonds\Nled Honoka back to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.83,0:00:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.08,0:00:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.58,0:01:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a minute. I guess since the fire...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.25,0:01:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Koyanagi? I was sure she'd come.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.33,0:01:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,So, she doesn't want to\Nbe involved with us anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.79,0:01:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,She must really not like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.58,0:01:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.95,0:01:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you want to talk to us about, Shuichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.08,0:01:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.12,0:01:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to give me all\Nthe coins you've gathered so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.20,0:01:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys can't fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.66,0:01:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave the rest of it to us\Nand return to your normal lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.91,0:01:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's hoping you'll all agree to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.79,0:01:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuichi. I still think you are a kind person.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.70,0:02:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for protecting us in the mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.08,0:02:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We only become one once,\Nbut I know I will never forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.75,0:02:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure you didn't have anything to say to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.58,0:02:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Like what? Yoshioka and I\Nlive in different worlds now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.70,0:02:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And I haven't done\Nanything that deserves thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.75,0:02:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,His whole attitude seems different, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.58,0:02:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. If we leave him be, at this rate...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.29,0:02:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoshioka. You made the right call.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.66,0:02:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll skip school tomorrow\Nand go into the mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.25,0:02:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What a weird thing for an honors student to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.91,0:02:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If you've got something to say, say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.41,0:02:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.75,0:03:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't we rent a movie or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.95,0:03:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We can watch it at your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.70,0:03:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.87,0:03:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we can head into\Nthe mountains the next morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.33,0:03:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Umm, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.95,0:03:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.95,0:03:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay then, I'll go home.\NIt doesn't matter to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.54,0:03:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's the end of us.\NWe only lasted one summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.66,0:03:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll forget everything that happened
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.75,0:03:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,and go back to how we were before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.37,0:03:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Come over then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.58,0:03:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,"We two are one," right?\NI'll always protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.41,0:03:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me, till the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.16,0:03:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't plan on simply being protected by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.50,0:03:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I know. But...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.04,0:04:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,...that's what I want to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.12,0:04:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuichi has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.08,0:04:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And I changed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.79,0:04:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't truly become one as we are now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.83,0:04:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something I need to know first.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.04,0:04:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, I just need to clean up really quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.95,0:04:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Weird... What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.12,0:04:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And what happened recently...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.08,0:04:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something about\NShuichi that's not normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.50,0:04:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.50,0:05:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuichi, this house...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.75,0:05:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, it's cramped but make yourself at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.87,0:05:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a couch if you want to sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.95,0:05:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not what I meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.29,0:05:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't worry about my parents.\NThey both work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.29,0:05:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it. Doesn't he see how this room is?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.04,0:05:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Shuichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.58,0:05:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.58,0:05:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So... Your parents come\Nhome late every night, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.87,0:05:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I always eat dinner alone\Nand then head upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.37,0:05:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been that way\Nsince I was little--I'm used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.45,0:05:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not what I'm talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.12,0:05:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about this hard, Shuichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.50,0:05:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,When was the last time you saw your parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.37,0:05:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? The last... time?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.91,0:06:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no doubt. This is Elena's work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.58,0:06:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't remember\Nbeing made to drink the medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.70,0:06:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,She can control what is inside someone's head...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.70,0:06:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No... Not just our parents... Shuichi's too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.95,0:06:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Shuichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.66,0:06:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all because you met us...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.79,0:06:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Cl... air...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.04,0:06:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay. Do whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.83,0:06:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.95,0:07:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuichi...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.50,0:07:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha--?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.87,0:07:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Kagaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.45,0:07:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I've released you from the pact.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.75,0:07:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We no longer have any kind of relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.70,0:07:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to the parking lot at the mall,\Ntomorrow evening at five.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.62,0:07:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll hand over all the coins we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.00,0:07:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Both of you must come. Good bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.75,0:07:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,How was that, Yoshioka?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.25,0:07:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, thank you, Koyanagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.79,0:07:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,None of us, or Shuichi,\Nshould continue collecting coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.41,0:07:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll give what we have to Elena...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.87,0:07:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,...and she'll put an end\Nto this game as quickly as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.79,0:07:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That's for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.79,0:07:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What time did Elena say?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.29,0:08:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow evening at five,\Nat the riverbank in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.54,0:08:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Yoshioka?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.83,0:08:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen her. I guess she's absent.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.04,0:08:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What are they up to...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.04,0:08:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuichi, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.75,0:08:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to talk\Nabout it if you don't want to...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.29,0:08:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,...but you've been strange ever since last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.16,0:08:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, yeah. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.00,0:08:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't really understand myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.04,0:08:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll talk about it once I've sorted things out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.75,0:08:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.37,0:08:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that what Elena used to look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.37,0:09:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Why was she at my house?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.33,0:09:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It felt like she was trying to protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.12,0:09:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep an eye on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.95,0:09:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.95,0:09:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It was inevitable that\NAiko's classmate would be erased.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.83,0:09:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I had used the process\Nlike I did with Shuichi,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.33,0:09:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I might have saved their lives, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.79,0:09:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Did revenge for Aiko keep me from doing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.66,0:09:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No. Each time you use the process,\Nit reduces your power.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.25,0:09:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And reduces our chances of defeating\Nthat thing by the same amount.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.37,0:09:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no other reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.04,0:09:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Is everything the same with Shuichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.95,0:09:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. During the fight, he pointed a gun at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.04,0:09:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He shouldn't remember anything about our bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.58,0:10:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. If that thing becomes\Naware of Shuichi again
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.41,0:10:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,and uses that bond to remember everything...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.12,0:10:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,...this world will end.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.04,0:10:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,"Academic Advisor"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.45,0:10:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,"Academic Advisor"\NThat's all. Just be sure to get\Nthe documents in before the deadline.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.29,0:10:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all. Just be sure to get\Nthe documents in before the deadline.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.20,0:10:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.37,0:10:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you feel about leaving this town?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.58,0:10:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You still have more than\Nhalf a year till graduation, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.75,0:10:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.79,0:10:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm definitely going to miss everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.45,0:10:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.16,0:10:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try to find Yoshioka by scent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.62,0:10:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Mmm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.62,0:11:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like being spied on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.04,0:11:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Not waterproof, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.20,0:11:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, I guess you can't contact Koyanagi, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.95,0:11:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Psh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.04,0:11:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me give you a tip.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.91,0:11:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You always look so detached,\Nyet you go through all this trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.29,0:11:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.66,0:11:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd probably have more fun\Nif you played hard to get.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.12,0:12:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Fucking slut...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.79,0:12:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I took care of her.\NWhere should I meet up with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.50,0:12:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Read"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.20,0:12:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No. I'm not giving you the coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.16,0:12:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Isao...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.50,0:12:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't act all friendly with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.20,0:12:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let it go, Isao. You're not a fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.16,0:12:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,--The riverbank. Yoshioka will be there.\N--What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.04,0:12:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.20,0:12:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess we won't see\Neach other after graduation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.08,0:13:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The riverbank?! Damn, I might not make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.37,0:13:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh... Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.04,0:13:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.08,0:13:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.95,0:13:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How has Shuichi been since the fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.66,0:13:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,How has he been...?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.62,0:13:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If you say... anything...\Nto him, you're over. Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.95,0:13:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Elena, I--
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.54,0:13:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You did it to protect me. Didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.04,0:13:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuichi, what are you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.37,0:13:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave. Your errand here is finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.16,0:13:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Did she just give you the coins?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.25,0:13:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you're not going to answer...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.29,0:14:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm not going to run away this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.83,0:14:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop. Here is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.29,0:14:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you. But why did you--
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.87,0:14:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Just go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.95,0:14:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what's going on,\Nbut Shuichi is waiting for you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.70,0:14:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I've always been... watching him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.37,0:14:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It came back to me last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.58,0:14:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It was only a small fragment,\Nbut I remembered something from before all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.37,0:14:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's true, then everything\NI've known up till now was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.79,0:14:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't bring me into this...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.62,0:14:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it I who brought you into it...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.29,0:14:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know. You're overthinking things.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.04,0:14:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to hear more about it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.12,0:14:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Clair!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.41,0:14:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I've done some investigating.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.20,0:15:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuichi, there is a connection in\Nyour past that I think you've forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.58,0:15:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Do either of you recognize this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.37,0:15:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.83,0:15:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"I saw Elena today."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.41,0:15:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuichi, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.08,0:15:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop remembering!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.08,0:15:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.33,0:15:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you steal them again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.04,0:15:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this and get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.70,0:15:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Get inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.08,0:15:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been protected\Nby your kindness, bound by it,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.33,0:15:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,kept from the truth all this time...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.20,0:15:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,...but it ends now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.66,0:16:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since last night, I keep thinking...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.33,0:16:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that really some way of protecting me, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.16,0:16:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what I've done is terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.75,0:16:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to make excuses.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.45,0:16:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,When I did it, I knew what it meant...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.37,0:16:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Shuichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.00,0:16:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget your powers, and everything else--
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.45,0:16:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Live a normal life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.66,0:16:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Naoto and I will take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.50,0:16:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the same as in my memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.20,0:16:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You have the same sad scent as Clair.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.20,0:16:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to cry anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.95,0:17:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You two can stop trying\Nto carry everything on your shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.37,0:17:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I am an empty monster. But because I am empty...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.08,0:17:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You could become one with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.16,0:17:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You gave me a place where I belonged.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.12,0:17:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Entering the emptiness inside of\Nyou filled the emptiness inside of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.41,0:17:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Clair!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.25,0:17:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.66,0:17:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.58,0:18:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You two...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.58,0:18:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.70,0:18:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Who am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.66,0:18:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You... are...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.08,0:18:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Ho... no...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.87,0:18:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,No! It's not her!\NThat thing is something else entirely!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.25,0:18:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.33,0:18:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.29,0:19:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What are these things?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.25,0:19:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Elena!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.04,0:19:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"I saw Elena today."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.75,0:19:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,A monster? Then there's no point in asking...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.37,0:20:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I am only interested in\Nthe bonds between people.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.70,0:20:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as they don't come... to the place...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.75,0:20:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.00,0:20:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care about monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.25,0:20:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait. What is "the place"?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.87,0:20:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Was... Was that...?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.33,0:20:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,To the place where the spaceship crashed?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.54,0:20:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You do not need to know that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.37,0:20:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I met the alien recently,\Nand this is what I told him:
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.33,0:20:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to get the 100 coins\Nbefore anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.70,0:20:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Clair and I are going\Nto put an end to this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.66,0:20:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.08,0:20:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I will bear the weight of\Nthe crimes you had to commit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.91,0:21:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be why I chose to take this form!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.95,0:21:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.12,0:21:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to end this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.45,0:21:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. I could always feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.87,0:21:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,There is an incredible story\Nbeing played out in this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.25,0:21:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm not the main character.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.29,0:21:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should step off the stage of this story
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.91,0:21:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,and return to a normal life... But...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.08,0:21:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen you two\Nfor a while. You look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.08,0:21:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, shall we head off to that crash site?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.66,0:21:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,--Yeah.\N--Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.66,0:21:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not the main character...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.45,0:21:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But when it comes time for the climax...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.00,0:22:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,...we two might be able to find the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.83,0:22:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to believe.
